## About the project

3e international school is a well established institute, that has a mission to develop creative thinkers and collaborative learners who are able to move respectfully and appreciatively across cultures.

I worked together with their communication team and PBB to design and develop a new website, that serves as a platform for publishing news and events. The latter was built on solid SEO guidelines allowing it to rank [**first**](https://www.google.com/search?biw=1344&bih=758&ei=cpfVXouTNIKemAWPyZ7wDg&q=international+Elementary+school+beijing&oq=international+Elementary+school+beijing&gs_lcp=CgZwc3ktYWIQAzIGCAAQCBAeOgQIABBHOgQIABBDOgYIABAHEB46AggAULSZBljWpAZgiKgGaABwA3gAgAHLAogB4gmSAQMzLTSYAQCgAQGgAQKqAQdnd3Mtd2l6&sclient=psy-ab&ved=0ahUKEwiLlLGx6uHpAhUCD6YKHY-kB-4Q4dUDCAw&uact=5) in SERP for the targeted keywords (as of 2018).

